---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../site.config";

const updated = "9 October 2026";
const link = "font-semibold text-sea-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-sea-500";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What sites.factsmith.co.za collects when you visit or send an enquiry, why, and how to ask for it to be removed."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-700">
      What this website collects, why, and what you can ask us to do with it. Last updated {updated}.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-ink-700 [&_h2]:font-display [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-ink-900 [&_p]:mt-2 [&_ul]:mt-2 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ul]:pl-5">
      <div>
        <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
        <p>
          {site.name} is run by {site.billingEntity}, South Africa. Questions about your information go to
          <a class={link} href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Visit statistics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to count visits: which pages are viewed, how visitors arrived (a search, a
          link, or directly), approximate location (country and city), and device and browser type. Google
          Analytics sets cookies so a repeat visit is not counted as a new visitor. It does not give us your
          name, and it does not store your IP address.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use this only to see which pages are useful and how people find the site. It is not used for
          advertising and it is not sold. Detailed visit data is kept for two months; after that only totals
          remain. Google processes this data for us and may do so outside South Africa.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Enquiries</h2>
        <p>
          If you send the enquiry form, we receive your name, the email or phone number you give, your town if
          you add it, and your message. The form is delivered by Formspree, a form service based in the United
          States. If you WhatsApp or email us instead, we see what you send there.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use your enquiry only to reply and, if you go ahead, to build your site. We do not add you to a
          mailing list, and we keep it only as long as we need it for that.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Block or delete cookies in your browser, or install Google's
            <a class={link} href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >Analytics opt-out add-on</a
            >. The site works the same without them.
          </li>
          <li>
            Ask what we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, at
            <a class={link} href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            If you are not happy with our answer, you can complain to the
            <a class={link} href="https://inforegulator.org.za" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >Information Regulator</a
            >.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Client sites</h2>
        <p>
          This notice covers sites.factsmith.co.za only. Websites we build for clients belong to those
          clients, and their own notices apply.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
